{"schema": 1, "ts": 1791081861, "iso": "2026-10-04T02:44:21Z", "kind": "fact", "tags": ["keeper", "session"], "source": "session:20261003_153455_501870", "text": "cron `keeper daily audit` (f192c5c8b5e4) corre cada dia 9am, deliver=all + attach_to_session, carga el skill keeper"}
{"schema": 1, "ts": 1791081861, "iso": "2026-10-04T02:44:21Z", "kind": "fact", "tags": ["keeper", "session"], "source": "session:20261003_153455_501870", "text": "los 10 plugins de usuario tenian __init__.py de 26-86 bytes (solo docstring); ahora 11/11 cargan con register() real"}
{"schema": 1, "ts": 1791081861, "iso": "2026-10-04T02:44:21Z", "kind": "fact", "tags": ["keeper", "session"], "source": "session:20261003_153455_501870", "text": "keeper://map es un mapa GENERADO: mide cada linea al imprimir; el mapa escrito a mano decia 128 conflictos (real: 0) y 10 plugins verdes (real: 1)"}
{"schema": 1, "ts": 1791081861, "iso": "2026-10-04T02:44:21Z", "kind": "fact", "tags": ["keeper", "session"], "source": "session:20261003_153455_501870", "text": "el store del droplet era solo en memoria: 16 records -> restart -> 0. Ahora persiste atomico (temp+os.replace+fsync): 12 -> restart -> 12"}
{"schema": 1, "ts": 1791081948, "iso": "2026-10-04T02:45:48Z", "kind": "incident", "tags": ["cron", "delivery", "keeper"], "source": "session:20261003_153455_501870", "text": "cron deliver=all FALLA el run entero cuando hay 0 plataformas conectadas ('no delivery target resolved for deliver=all'). El gateway reporta 'No messaging platforms enabled' y '0 target(s)'. Usar deliver=local hasta que haya un canal real."}
{"schema": 1, "ts": 1791081948, "iso": "2026-10-04T02:45:48Z", "kind": "incident", "tags": ["cron", "delivery", "keeper"], "source": "session:20261003_153455_501870", "text": "un fallo de ENTREGA no es un fallo de TAREA: el audit de keeper corrio perfecto (verdict coherent, map 6/6) y el run se marco error solo por el destino. Distinguir last_status=delivery_failed de last_error."}
{"schema": 1, "ts": 1791081948, "iso": "2026-10-04T02:45:48Z", "kind": "incident", "tags": ["cron", "delivery", "keeper"], "source": "session:20261003_153455_501870", "text": "los outputs de cron se guardan en ~/.hermes/cron/output/<job_id>/<fecha>.md aunque la entrega falle — leerlos ahi para separar fallo de entrega de fallo de tarea."}
